| 🔴 Critical | 1 | Hardcoded secrets in source code |
| 🟠 High | 2 | Missing security headers, No rate limiting |
| 🟡 Medium | 6 | Incomplete CORS, No input auth, No HTTPS, No auth middleware, No body limits |
