The application has no rate limiting protection on any endpoints:
- `/health` and `/users` endpoints are completely unprotected
- Any authenticated or unauthenticated user can make unlimited requests
- **Impact:** Vulnerable to DoS attacks, brute force attacks, resource exhaustion

---

